      <h3>Part B: Realigning or Replacing Crooked, Sticking Drawer Channels</h3>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Empty and Remove the Drawer:</strong> Pull the drawer out to its absolute maximum extension. Look at the exposed metal side channels on both sides.</li>
