      <p>You care for your potted balcony garden every single day, keeping your hibiscus, money plants, areca palms, and basil blooming. But the moment you leave town for a five-day family vacation or a busy work trip during hot weather, you return home to brittle yellow foliage, shriveled buds, and dried-out pots that cannot be salvaged. Or you're simply tired of carrying heavy watering cans across your living room twice a day during peak 40°C Indian summers.</p>

