      <p>A slamming balcony door isn't just annoying — over months, it stresses hinges, cracks glass, and loosens the whole door frame. A magnetic catcher or a properly aligned tower bolt solves this permanently for the cost of a masala dosa, and both are genuinely doable solo in under an hour.</p>

