    excerpt: 'Confused between wood polish vs laminate finish? Learn about durability, costs, and aesthetics to make the right choice for your Indian home.',
    category: 'Carpentry',
    date: 'May 13, 2026',
    readTime: '6 min read',
    image: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1533090161767-e6ffed986c88?q=80&w=2069&auto=format&fit=crop',
    content: `
      <p>When designing wooden furniture, the finish determines not just how the piece looks, but also how long it lasts. Two of the most popular furniture finishing options in India are <strong>wood polish vs laminate</strong> finishes.</p>
      <p>Let's compare these finishes to see which option is best for your custom home projects.</p>
      <h2>1. Aesthetic Appearance</h2>
      <p>Wood polish (like PU, Melamine, or French polish) highlights the natural grain, texture, and elegance of solid wood or wood veneers. It gives a luxurious, warm look that feels natural to the touch. Laminates, on the other hand, are synthetic sheets that mimic wood, stone, or solid colours. While modern laminates look highly realistic, they lack the organic texture of real polished wood.</p>
      <h2>2. Durability and Maintenance</h2>
      <p>Laminates are highly durable, scratch-resistant, water-resistant, and require almost zero maintenance. A simple wipe with a damp cloth keeps them clean. Wood polish is more susceptible to water marks, heat damage, and scratches. It requires careful cleaning and needs a fresh re-polish every 5 to 7 years to keep its shine.</p>
      <h2>3. Cost Comparison</h2>
      <p>Laminates are a cost-effective choice for wardrobes, kitchens, and study tables. Wood polishing veneer or solid teak wood is a premium process that requires skilled labour and high-grade materials, making it significantly more expensive.</p>
      <h2>Verdict</h2>
      <p>For high-wear areas like kitchen cabinets, kids' study desks, and internal shelves, laminates are the best choice. For formal dining tables, primary entrance doors, and focal living room showpieces, wood polish offers unmatched aesthetic luxury.</p>
    `
